+# Proposal
+
+## Why
+
+The desk needs to see at a glance what can still be rented for a given period. Today it can only try `book` and see whether it throws.
+
+## What Changes
+
+- Add `availability({ start, end, kind? })` to the rental service. It returns the sorted ids of the equipment, of the given kind or of any kind when `kind` is omitted, that is free for the whole period.
+- The period follows the existing whole-day UTC rules; an invalid period, or an unknown `kind` when one is given, throws.
+- Update the README rental section.
+
+## Capabilities
+
+### New Capabilities
+
+### Modified Capabilities
+- `equipment-rental`: adds an availability query requirement.
+
+## Impact
+
+- `src/rental.ts` (service interface and implementation), `src/rental.test.ts`, `README.md`.
+- No change to existing operations or data.
